Development Environment:
	Frontend: React.js
	Backend: Express/Node
	Version Control: Git + GitHub
	Deployment: TBD
	Testing: TBD

Configurating the Environment:
	1. Install Prerequisites - Nodejs & npm, git
	2. Fetch the repository
			"git clone <repo_url>"
	3. Setup Backend
			"cd backend"
			"npm install"
	4. Setup Frontend
			"cd frontend"
			"npm install"
	5. Add testing
		TBD

Running the Application
	Open 2 terminals

	Terminal 1: 
		cd backend
		nodemon server.js # Use node server.js if nodemon does not work

	Terminal 2:
		cd frontend
		npm run dev

	On browser, navigate to: "http://localhost:5173"

